# The GBA page with art (Settings' game view, slot 31): START opens the game
# popup beside the list with art, whose tiles leave block 0 short: v0.5's
# first 8-item popup didn't fit at all (START did nothing). Its 6 items keep
# their title; a popup that still doesn't fit opens without it. On Game
# 001: a long name's row scrolls, which would make the shot depend on timing.
#! settings 31=1
#! sd-file "/torii/art/custom/A name too long to fit on its row.gba.bin" 0 tests/shots/data/art-sunset.bin
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-w "box art: cover"
-k @10:DOWN -k @14:- -k @22:DOWN -k @26:-
-k @60:START -k @64:-
-w "screen ready: game-popup"
-s @30:popup.png
